 :decision
 "Implement cloud-itonami-isic-2829 with Advisor/Governor/Phase/Registry/Store/
  Operation/Sim (mirrors cloud-itonami-isic-2823 module-for-module, adapted
  from metallurgy-machinery to printing-press manufacturing --
  printpressmfg.* namespace, Special-Purpose Machinery Plant Operations
  Governor):
  - Governor: twelve concrete HARD checks elaborating four HARD invariants
    (propose-only effect, closed op allowlist, closed proposal-effect
    allowlist / no direct fabrication-line control, permanent equipment-
    actuate block, permanent certification-authority block) plus a
    confidence/high-stakes escalation gate (SOFT, human may approve)
  - Registry: pure functions -- equipment/batch verified+registered gates,
    shipment-quantity-exceeded recompute, product-type-valid? (6-member
    closed set: offset/flexographic/gravure/digital-inkjet/screen-printing
    press, die-cutting-press), registration-accuracy-mm-valid? (0.0 to
    5.0mm), defect-rate-valid? (0.0 to 100.0%) -- replacing 2823's
    load-test-tonnes-valid? (0.0 to 100000.0t)
  - Store: Store protocol + MemStore (SSoT + append-only audit ledger,
    sample batches/equipment seeded for offline tests/demo)
  - Advisor: PrintPressAdvisor -- deterministic mock (default) + llm-advisor
    (langchain.model-backed, same proposal-EDN contract)
  - Phase: 0->3 rollout gate, :schedule-maintenance permanently absent from
    every phase's :auto set (structural, not a milestone)
  - Operation: PrintPressOperationActor -- full langgraph-clj StateGraph
    (advise -> govern -> decide -> commit|hold|request-approval), real
    interrupt-before/resume approval workflow
  - Sim: demo runner (-main) exercising all four happy paths + eleven
    HARD-hold scenarios directly
  - Ops (closed allowlist, all :effect :propose): log-production-batch
    (product-type/registration-accuracy-mm/quantity/defect-rate data
    logging), schedule-maintenance (fabrication/assembly-commissioning-
    bench-equipment maintenance scheduling), flag-safety-concern
    (equipment-safety/quality-defect concern -- ALWAYS escalates),
    coordinate-shipment (outbound printing-press-machinery shipment
    coordination)
  - Tests: 70 tests / 201 assertions across
    governor-contract/phase/registry/store-contract, all green
  - All .cljc (portable, no JVM interop), AGPL-3.0-or-later
  - GitHub repo created directly as cloud-itonami-isic-2829 (no rename
    needed)"

